(1) The Board shall consist of the following members —

(a) the Director of Nursing Services, who shall be the chairman;

(b) three Principal Nursing Officers;

(c) the Principal of the Pengiran Anak Puteri Rashidah Sa'adatul Bolkiah College of Nursing;

(d) three Senior Nursing Officers;

(e) a nursing officer from the Panaga Health Centre; [S 91/2006]

(f) a senior administrative officer from the Ministry of Health;

(g) a medical officer;

(h) a former nurse.

(2) The members of the Board shall be appointed by the Minister for such period as he may think fit and shall be eligible for re-appointment.

(3) The Minister shall appoint one of the members of the Board referred to in sub-regulation (1)(d) to be the secretary.

(4) Notice of appointments under sub-regulation (1) shall be published in the Gazette. 4 CAP. 140, Rg 1 Nurses Registration

(5) In this regulation, “Minister” means the Minister of Health. Meetings of Board
